OL,3,GNEWSAHospital urgent and emergency care
OL,4,Adowngraded by CQC
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe urgent and emergency care provision
OL,7,Fat a Sussex hospital has been
OL,8,Fdowngraded by the Care Quality
OL,9,FCommission (CQC) following an
OL,10,Finspection earlier this year.
OL,12,FConquest Hospital in St Leonards has
OL,13,Fgone from good to requires improvement,
OL,14,Fwhile in a separate report, the
OL,15,Fprovision at Eastbourne District
OL,16,FGeneral Hospital remained as requires
OL,17,Fimprovement.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
