OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHospital urgent and emergency care
OL,4,Adowngraded by CQC
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmanda Williams, CQC deputy director of
OL,7,Fhospitals, secondary and specialist
OL,8,Fcare in the South East, said inspectors
OL,9,Ffound staff under significant pressure
OL,10,F"struggling to provide safe and
OL,11,Feffective care".
OL,13,FEast Sussex Healthcare NHS Trust, which
OL,14,Fruns both hospitals, said it accepted
OL,15,Fthe findings and changes had been made
OL,16,Fsince the inspections.
